dialogue_lines = Array[String](["Finally, you're awake!", "It took me so long to find you...", "Please, I know I'm a stranger, but hear me out.", "Each century, a child is born with the ability to see Slimes. As you know, you were that child, but your calling eluded you without a mentor.", "I am that mentor: a hero past his prime, washed up, seeking to pass the torch.", "Your first quest is thus, Slayer... Defeat a Slime!"])
